"discovery-enabled` is not required in this case."
msgstr ""

msgid "Supported token grants"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The main token grants that `OidcClient` can use to acquire the tokens are "
"the `client_credentials` (default) and `password` grants."
msgstr ""

