msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Then, you can use the `OidcClient.accessTokens` method to accept a Map of "
"extra properties and pass the current `code` and `redirect_uri` parameters "
"to exchange the authorization code for the tokens."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"`OidcClient` also supports the `urn:openid:params:grant-type:ciba` grant:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Then, you can use the `OidcClient.accessTokens` method to accept a Map of "
"extra properties and pass the `auth_req_id` parameter to exchange the token "
"authorization code."
