msgid "OIDC request filters"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can filter OIDC requests made by the OIDC client to the OIDC provider by "
"registering one or more `OidcRequestFilter` implementations, which can "
"update or add new request headers, customize or analyze the request body."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can have a single filter intercept requests to all OIDC provider "
"endpoints, or use an `@OidcEndpoint` annotation to apply this filter to "
"requests to specific endpoints only."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"`OidcRequestContextProperties` can be used to access request properties.\n"
"Currently, you can use a `client_id` key to access the client tenant ID and "
"a `grant_type` key to access the grant type that the OIDC client uses to "
"acquire tokens."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"`OidcRequestFilter` can customize the request body by updating it with a "
"`String` or by preparing an instance of `io.vertx.mutiny.core.buffer.Buffer` "
"and setting it on a request context, for example:"
